{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0008", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "Chriſtus Iohannis Baptiſtæ teſtimonio Iudæis com-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "Christ had been commended to the Jews by the testimony of John the Baptist;", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0008"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 8}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0009", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "mendatus; quod quidem veriſſimum ampliſſimum-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "which testimony was indeed most true and most ample,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0009"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 9}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0010", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "q́ue fuit, nec à Iudæis ipſis contemni potuit, apud", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "and could not be despised even by the Jews themselves, among", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0010"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 10}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0011", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "quos ſummo in honore Iohannes precioq́ue vixit.", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "whom John lived in the highest honour and esteem.", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0011"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 11}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0012", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "Hoc tamen Iohannis teſtimonio alia ſe Chriſtus ha-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "Yet Christ affirms that he has, beyond this testimony of John, other things", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0012"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 12}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0013", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "bere affirmat maiora, certiora, auguſtiora: eaq́; tria", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "greater, more certain, and more august; and he mentions three such things.", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0013"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 13}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0014", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "commemorat. Primum, opera, quæ fecit. Secundũ,", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "First, the works which he did. Second,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0014"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 14}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0015", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "patrem ſuum, à quo miſſus fuit. Tertium, ſacras i-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "his Father, by whom he was sent. Third, the sacred", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0015"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 15}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0016", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "pſas Scripturas, quas teſtes ſuas vocat. Et quidem de", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "Scriptures themselves, which he calls his witnesses. And indeed concerning", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0016"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 16}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0017", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "Scripturis Iudæi honorificè ſentiebant, in iiſque vi-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "the Scriptures the Jews held an honourable opinion, and hoped that in them", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0017"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 17}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0018", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "tam æternam inueniri poſſe ſperabant. Quod illo-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "eternal life could be found. This judgement of theirs", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0018"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 18}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0019", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "rum de Scripturis iudicium Chriſtus minimè repre-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "concerning the Scriptures Christ in no way", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0019"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 19}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0020", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "hendit, ſed laudat potiùs, iubetq́ue vt pergant Scri-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "reproves, but rather commends, and bids them go on searching", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0020"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 20}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0021", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "pturas ſcrutari, eorumque omnino erga Scripturas", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "the Scriptures, and altogether inflames their zeal toward the Scriptures", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0021"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 21}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0022", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ſtudium inflammat, induſtriamq́; acuit. Hortatur e-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "and sharpens their diligence. For he exhorts them", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0022"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 22}
