{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0024", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "etiam, penitusq́; excutiant : ita eos non tenui lectio-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "and to examine them thoroughly: thus he does not want them to be content with a slight reading,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0024"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 24}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0025", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ne contentos eſſe vult, ſed aſſiduam, acrem, labo-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "but requires a constant, keen, and laborious", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0025"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 25}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0026", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "rioſam inueſtigandi perſcrutandiq́; diligentiam re-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "diligence of investigating and scrutinising,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0026"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 26}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0027", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "quirit, qualem illi adhibere ſolent, qui defoſſum in", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "such as those are accustomed to apply who most diligently seek a treasure buried in", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0027"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 27}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0030_body_l0028", "page_id": "p0030", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "terra theſaurum diligentiſſimè quærunt,", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "the ground,", "notes": "Sentence continues onto the next page.", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0030_body_l0028"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 28}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0001", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "Et quando Chriſtus ſine exceptione iuſſit ſcruta-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "And when Christ commanded without exception that the sacred Scriptures be searched—", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0001"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 1}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0002", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ri ſacras Scripturas, nó has modò, aut illas, aut quaſ-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "not only these, or those, or certain of them—", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0002"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 2}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0003", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "dam; manifeſtum eſt, his verbis præſcribi, vt vniuer-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "it is plain that by these words it is prescribed that we search", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0003"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 3}
