{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0005", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "hærentes contemnamus aut prætermittamus reli-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "despise or pass over the rest.", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0005"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 5}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0006", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "quas. Omnes enim Chriſto non obſcurum teſtimo-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "For all of them give no obscure testimony to Christ.", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0006"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 6}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0007", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "nium dicunt. Scripturas autem & Papiſtæ celebrãt,", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "Now the Papists too celebrate the Scriptures,", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0007"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 7}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0008", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "& nos in maximo precio habemus: & ſcrutandas eſ-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "and we hold them in the highest esteem; and that the Scriptures must be searched", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0008"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 8}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0009", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ſe Scripturas à nobis nulla omnino controuerſia eſt:", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "is, on our side, no matter of controversy at all;", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0009"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 9}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0010", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "verú de modo, quo eas ſcrutari oporteat, & ad quos", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "but concerning the manner in which they ought to be searched, and to whom", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0010"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 10}
{"segment_id": "seg_p0031_body_l0011", "page_id": "p0031", "segment_type": "body", "latin_text": "ea cura ſpectet, déque ipſis Scripturis, quas ſcrutan-", "markers": [], "translation_history": [{"version": 1, "stage": "machine_draft", "timestamp": "2026-05-17T01:25:24Z", "english": "that responsibility belongs, and concerning the Scriptures themselves which we", "notes": "", "uncertain": false, "model": "claude-opus-4-7", "lexicon_profile": "auto", "source_unit_id": "p0031_body_l0011"}], "final_english": "", "translation_status": "machine_draft", "seq": 11}
